// Phase 4: Creation
edit_file("official-documentation/front-end/components/button.md",
          "Create comprehensive Button component documentation",
          "# Button Component\n\n## Purpose\n\nThe Button component provides a standardized, accessible button implementation with consistent styling across the PolygonExpress platform. It supports multiple variants, sizes, and states, with built-in loading indicators and icon support.\n\n## Component Architecture\n\n```mermaid\ngraph TD\n    Button[Button] --> BaseButton[BaseButton]\n    Button --> Icon[Icon Component]\n    Button --> Spinner[Loading Spinner]\n    \n    BaseButton --> ButtonStyles[Button Styles]\n    \n    subgraph \"Button Components\"\n        Button\n        BaseButton\n    end\n    \n    subgraph \"Supporting Components\"\n        Icon\n        Spinner\n        ButtonStyles\n    end\n```\n\n## Props Interface\n\n```typescript\ninterface ButtonProps extends React.ButtonHTMLAttributes<HTMLButtonElement> {\n  /** Button display variant */\n  variant?: 'primary' | 'secondary' | 'text';\n  /** Button size */\n  size?: 'small' | 'medium' | 'large';\n  /** Show loading spinner */\n  isLoading?: boolean;\n  /** Disable the button */\n  disabled?: boolean;\n  /** Start icon component */\n  startIcon?: React.ReactNode;\n  /** End icon component */\n  endIcon?: React.ReactNode;\n  /** Full width button */\n  fullWidth?: boolean;\n}\n```\n\n## Usage Examples\n\n```tsx\nimport { Button } from '@/components';\n\n// Basic usage\n<Button onClick={handleClick}>Click Me</Button>\n\n// Variants and sizes\n<Button variant=\"primary\" size=\"large\">Primary Large</Button>\n<Button variant=\"secondary\" size=\"medium\">Secondary Medium</Button>\n<Button variant=\"text\" size=\"small\">Text Small</Button>\n\n// With icons\n<Button startIcon={<IconSearch />}>Search</Button>\n<Button endIcon={<IconArrowRight />}>Next</Button>\n\n// Loading state\n<Button isLoading={isSubmitting} onClick={handleSubmit}>Submit</Button>\n\n// Disabled state\n<Button disabled={!isValid} onClick={handleSubmit}>Submit</Button>\n\n// Full width\n<Button fullWidth onClick={handleSubmit}>Submit Form</Button>\n```\n\n## Accessibility Features\n\n- Preserves native button accessibility features\n- Maintains focus states for keyboard navigation\n- Loading state announced to screen readers\n- Color contrast meets WCAG AA standards\n- Includes proper aria attributes when needed\n\n## Related Components\n\n- [Icon Component](./icon.md) - Icon system used with buttons\n- [Button Group](./button-group.md) - Container for button groups\n- [Form Controls](./form-controls.md) - Form input elements")

// Phase 5: Verification
codebase_search("Button component usage", ["front-end/src"])
```

